    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/6a17a9b3eee56f95d90a75a0_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_034-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/6a1751727e01cbae8baa1a1a_dreamproductions_main_03-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/6a1751722e3e5a94224720f8_dreamproductions_main_01-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/6a17a9b46fa0aacf36b6065f_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_175-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    }
   ],
   "html": "<p>Disney hosted a small group of creators at Pixar Studios to celebrate the upcoming Disney+ release of Dream Productions, a special 4-part series centered around the movie studio from <em>Inside Out</em> that develops nightly adventures in Riley’s sleeping mind. </p>\n<p>To cap the day of exploration, IHC produced an immersive, multi-sensory five course dinner that turned dreams into reality – complete with a whimsical tablescape, personalized place settings and other-worldly dishes.</p>\n<p>To achieve this we collaborated with chef, artist and food designer, Jen Monroe, of Bad Taste, noted for her commitment to boundary-pushing, fantastical food exploration.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>As guests entered the venue their senses were immediately captivated by a harpist weaving ethereal melodies. Friendly staff, styled in cozy pajamas, offered guests a choice of two signature themed cocktails or a non-alcoholic alternative.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests were ushered into a private dining room where guest chef, Jen Monroe, welcomed everyone. With each course, the harp sounded, cueing the lighting to shift, bathing the room in evolving colors, and immersing guests in a multisensory journey.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a175f807db7a603d7e2886e_dreamproductions_decor_02-p-2000.avif",
