       "src": "/images/6a1751719f26e0be2488caf8_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_112-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a17abe201e24bf3477583eb_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_188-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a1756fb46bd08018fb305b3_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_181-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a175172411443935beb3681_dreamproductions_main_06-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a1756fa1fdaacf23f013212_pixar_DPdinner_photo-by-meghanmcneer_244-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "MENU",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Dream Productions introduces categorical genres that all dreams exist within. Our dinner embraced and connected these to what was served, while retaining the colorful, playful and whimsical intentions the <em>Inside Out </em>franchise has become known for. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Each course gave guests a slightly surreal and dreamlike experience. The dinner consisted of an amuse-bouche served on a dry ice plate, a maze shaped carrot and watermelon salad, a colorful and candy-shaped pasta, a pop rock rainbow unicorn ice cream cone, and a mignardise daydream with a cloud jelly and gelatin balloon.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a175d29e26efe4dcc6bb73c_dreamproductions_menu_03-p-2000.avif",
