    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "DECOR",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Leaning into the themes of the show, we transformed the space into an immersive dreamscape complete with lush greenery, in-world movie posters, and a gobo light of the show’s title treatment. The room was bathed in the soft glow of candlelight, enhancing the dreamlike atmosphere, with glowing stars and drapery suspended above.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Fantastical decor and details created a magical private dining experience. Each place setting was designed with its own distinct color scheme, a personalized sleep mask and printed menu, adding an extra layer of thoughtfulness to the experience. </p>\n<p>‍</p>"
    },
